.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH g-workflow-start 1  "g-workflow-start " 
.SH NAME
g\-workflow\-start \- Start a new branch using workflow rules
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBg\-workflow\-start\fR [\fB\-\-from\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-verify\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITYPE\fR> <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Start a new branch using workflow rules
.PP
Creates a branch with the proper prefix, from the correct source branch, according to the workflow\*(Aqs branch type configuration.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<BRANCH>\fR
Override the source branch
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-verify\fR
Skip validation checks
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fITYPE\fR>
Branch type (e.g., feature, hotfix, release)
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Branch name (without prefix)
